```mermaid
flowchart LR
  X[输入状态] --> QKV[QKV Linear]
  QKV --> F1[融合：拆分 QKV + RoPE + Flash 布局]
  F1 --> ATTN[FlashAttention]
  ATTN --> OP[输出 Linear]
  X --> CAT[融合：A/B FP32 state + BF16 message 拼接]
  OP --> CAT
  CAT --> L0[FFN Linear0]
  L0 --> F2[融合：LayerNorm + affine + GELU + BF16 cast]
  F2 --> L3[FFN Linear3]
  L3 --> F3[融合：FP32 residual + BF16 projection]
```
